          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Is breastfeeding ever harmful for infants?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is breastfeeding bad for the baby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "While breastfeeding offers numerous benefits, it can be harmful to infants in specific circumstances. For example, if a mother uses certain drugs like cocaine, these substances can pass into breast milk. Due to a neonate's undeveloped metabolic capacity, exposure to even small doses of such drugs could persist and cause considerable harm to the infant.",
