          "user_utterance": "Is breastfeeding ever harmful for infants?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is breastfeeding bad for the baby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Breastfeeding may not be safe for your baby if the mother has certain medical conditions, takes specific medicines, or uses harmful drugs, as these substances can pass through breast milk and be detrimental to the infant. Additionally, a fully breastfed baby might be more prone to being underfed compared to a bottle-fed baby.",
