          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. - Interested in the nutritional content and potential deficiencies (specifically calcium and protein) in breastfed infants.",
            "2. I think I don't get enough calcium, and I am worried about it.",
            "3. - Preferences/Concerns: The user is concerned about the safety and effects of their low-carb diet on breast milk and infant health during breastfeeding.",
            "4. - Lifestyle: The user is actively preparing for or is currently in the breastfeeding stage.",
