          "user_utterance": "Can breastfeeding ever be bad for an infant?",
          "user_rubrik": "Is breastfeeding bad for the baby?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "While breastfeeding offers many benefits, there are limited circumstances where it might pose challenges for an infant. A baby may experience distress if separated from their mother, potentially leading to increased stress levels. Additionally, mothers might need to avoid certain foods if their baby cannot tolerate them, to prevent adverse reactions in the infant.",
